{"id":"7be47cc899abd763","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-fo-count-thc0.md","title":"有序结构上的计数逻辑刻画一阶一致阈值电路","display":"thm-fo-count-thc0 — 有序结构上的计数逻辑刻画一阶一致阈值电路","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-fo-count-thc0","aliases":["29-thm-fo-count-thc0"],"display":"thm-fo-count-thc0 — 有序结构上的计数逻辑刻画一阶一致阈值电路","depends_on":["[[29-df-fo-q-fo]]","[[29-df-fo-count]]","[[29-df-fo-number]]","[[29-df-circuit-classes]]","[[29-df-ordering]]"],"source_locator":"Proposition 12.16, p.187, DjVu scan 202; Definition 12.11, pp.186–187, scans 201–202; p.84, scan 99","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本层；核验范围见 Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-fo-count-thc0"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-fo-count-thc0</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-fo-count-thc0 — 有序结构上的计数逻辑刻画一阶一致阈值电路"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" href=\"?note=b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" title=\"29-df-fo-q-fo\">29-df-fo-q-fo</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"73b9dab9126dbc32\" href=\"?note=73b9dab9126dbc32\" title=\"29-df-fo-count\">29-df-fo-count</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"edcb3c1ba71c78c8\" href=\"?note=edcb3c1ba71c78c8\" title=\"29-df-fo-number\">29-df-fo-number</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6b1e7a4a516bab79\" href=\"?note=6b1e7a4a516bab79\" title=\"29-df-circuit-classes\">29-df-circuit-classes</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" href=\"?note=4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" title=\"29-df-ordering\">29-df-ordering</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Proposition 12.16, p.187, DjVu scan 202; Definition 12.11, pp.186–187, scans 201–202; p.84, scan 99"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本层；核验范围见 Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为有限关系输入词汇；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\\notin\\tau\">\\(&lt;\\notin\\tau\\)</span> 是新增的线性序符号，输入为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>；实际结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)\">\\(\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" href=\"?note=b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" title=\"29-df-fo-q-fo\">29-df-fo-q-fo</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{FO(COUNT)}}[\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;\\}]\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{FO(COUNT)}}[\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;\\}]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathrm{COUNT}}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathrm{COUNT}}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"73b9dab9126dbc32\" href=\"?note=73b9dab9126dbc32\" title=\"29-df-fo-count\">29-df-fo-count</a> 的双排序计数逻辑；数值排序及其标准算术解释见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"edcb3c1ba71c78c8\" href=\"?note=edcb3c1ba71c78c8\" title=\"29-df-fo-number\">29-df-fo-number</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ThC}^0[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{ThC}^0[\\tau]\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"6b1e7a4a516bab79\" href=\"?note=6b1e7a4a516bab79\" title=\"29-df-circuit-classes\">29-df-circuit-classes</a> 的一阶一致、常深度、多项式大小阈值电路查询类，使用相同的有序输入编码。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl\\{\\{U\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\mid\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)\\models_{\\mathrm{COUNT}}\\phi\\}\\mid\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{FO(COUNT)}}[\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;\\}]\\bigr\\}=\\mathrm{ThC}^0[\\tau].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl\\{\\{U\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\mid\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)\\models_{\\mathrm{COUNT}}\\phi\\}\\mid\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{FO(COUNT)}}[\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;\\}]\\bigr\\}=\\mathrm{ThC}^0[\\tau].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Proposition 12.16，印刷页 187、扫描页 202；Definition 12.11，印刷页 186–187、扫描页 201–202，给出双排序语法；阈值电路与多数数量词关系也见 p.84、扫描页 99。已核对命题陈述、双排序定义及与 Theorem 5.27 的衔接；原书 Exercise 12.17 要求证明该命题，本次未独立完成此练习，也未重验外引 BIS88 的全部电路对应。数值变量属于标准数值域，计数量词不是以无序对象元素直接充作阈值。本条不省略有序输入条件，且采用书中的一阶一致性。</p>\n<p>本轮将 COUNT 满足关系的输入改为 O_tau(U)；模型类仍保留原始有序对 U，因此与电路查询类比较的是同一个集合。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-fo-q-fo","status":"resolved","id":"b89b00b2e37a4ae5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-q-fo]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-count","status":"resolved","id":"73b9dab9126dbc32","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-count]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-number","status":"resolved","id":"edcb3c1ba71c78c8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-number]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-circuit-classes","status":"resolved","id":"6b1e7a4a516bab79","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-circuit-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ordering","status":"resolved","id":"4f651c8d1bdc9a58","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ordering]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-q-fo","status":"resolved","id":"b89b00b2e37a4ae5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau$ 为有限关系输入词汇；$<\\notin\\tau$ 是新增的线性序符号，输入为 $U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]$；实际结构 $\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)$ 见 [[29-df-fo-q-fo]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-count","status":"resolved","id":"73b9dab9126dbc32","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{FO(COUNT)}}[\\tau\\cup\\{<\\}]$、$\\models_{\\mathrm{COUNT}}$ 使用 [[29-df-fo-count]] 的双排序计数逻辑；数值排序及其标准算术解释见 [[29-df-fo-number]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-number","status":"resolved","id":"edcb3c1ba71c78c8","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{FO(COUNT)}}[\\tau\\cup\\{<\\}]$、$\\models_{\\mathrm{COUNT}}$ 使用 [[29-df-fo-count]] 的双排序计数逻辑；数值排序及其标准算术解释见 [[29-df-fo-number]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-circuit-classes","status":"resolved","id":"6b1e7a4a516bab79","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ThC}^0[\\tau]$ 取 [[29-df-circuit-classes]] 的一阶一致、常深度、多项式大小阈值电路查询类，使用相同的有序输入编码。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"<\\notin\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{FO(COUNT)}}[\\tau\\cup\\{<\\}]","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_{\\mathrm{COUNT}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ThC}^0[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigl\\{\\{U\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\mid\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)\\models_{\\mathrm{COUNT}}\\phi\\}\\mid\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{FO(COUNT)}}[\\tau\\cup\\{<\\}]\\bigr\\}=\\mathrm{ThC}^0[\\tau].","display":true}],"bytes":2171,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-68","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[29-thm-fo-count-thc0]] — FO(COUNT) 与均匀 `\\mathrm{ThC}^0`"},{"id":"805a7de3b1249a36","anchor":"ref-63","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-thm-fo-count-thc0]]"}